Složené závorky
***************

.[perex]
Sekce `braces` rozhoduje o složených závorkách: na kterém řádku stojí otevírací závorka třídy, funkce, closure (anonymní funkce) a řídicí struktury, kam patří `else` a `catch`, jak se píše prázdné tělo a kdy jsou závorky povinné.

Kam patří `{`, je nejviditelnější rozhodnutí každého stylu a zároveň to, na kterém se styly nejčastěji rozcházejí. Proto má každý druh konstrukce vlastní klíč: třída, funkce, funkce s parametry na několika řádcích, closure, anonymní třída a řídicí struktura. PSR-12 a [PER Coding Style 3.1 |https://www.php-fig.org/per/coding-style/] dávají deklaracím závorku na další řádek a všemu ostatnímu na řádek hlavičky:

```neon
braces:
	class: nextLine
	function: nextLine
	closure: sameLine
	controlStructure: sameLine
	continuingKeyword: sameLine
```

```php .[before]
class Cart {  // Expected a line break before the opening brace.
	public function add(Item $item): void {  // Expected a line break before the opening brace.
		if ($item->isFree())
		{  // Expected no line break before the opening brace.
			return;
		}
		$this->items[] = $item;
	}
}
```

```php .[after]
class Cart
{
	public function add(Item $item): void
	{
		if ($item->isFree()) {
			return;
		}
		$this->items[] = $item;
	}
}
```

Kromě otevírací závorky se hlídá, že za ní tělo začíná na novém řádku a že zavírací závorka stojí na řádku sama. Výjimky mají vlastní klíče: prázdné tělo `{}` (`emptyBody`), prázdná anonymní třída (`emptyAnonymousClass`) a closure napsaná celá na jednom řádku (`singlelineClosure`). Odsazení řádků, které tak vzniknou, je věc sekce [indentation |indentation], prázdné řádky za závorkou a před ní sekce [blankLines |blankLines].


braces.bracelessBody
====================

The body of a control structure written without braces, `if ($a) foo();`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `forbidden`, psr12 `forbidden`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `control_structure_braces`, `Generic.ControlStructures.InlineControlStructure` .[decision-facts]

```neon
braces:
	bracelessBody: forbidden
```

```php .[before]
if ($item->isFree()) return;  // The body of the `if` must be enclosed in braces.
```

```php .[after]
if ($item->isFree()) {
	return;
}
```


braces.alternativeSyntax
========================

`if: … endif;` is written with braces.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `no_alternative_syntax` .[decision-facts]


braces.bareStatementGroup
=========================

No `{ … }` around statements that nothing opens.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `forbidden` · pokrývá `no_unneeded_braces`, `no_unneeded_curly_braces` .[decision-facts]


braces.class
============

Where the `{` of a class, an interface, a trait and an enum stands, the members starting a line below it and the `}` taking a line of its own.

- `sameLine`: on the line of what comes before
- `nextLine`: on the next line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `nextLine`, psr12 `nextLine`, nette `nextLine`, symfony `nextLine` · pokrývá `braces_position`, `PSR2.Classes.ClassDeclaration` .[decision-facts]

```neon
braces:
	class: sameLine
```

```php .[before]
class Cart
{  // Expected no line break before the opening brace.
	private array $items = [];
}
```

```php .[after]
class Cart {
	private array $items = [];
}
```


braces.function
===============

Where the `{` of a function and of a method whose parameters stand on one line stands, the `{` of a property hook and of the list of hooks staying on the line of its head; the body starts a line below it and the `}` takes a line of its own.

- `nextLine`: on the next line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `nextLine`, psr12 `nextLine`, nette `nextLine`, symfony `nextLine` · pokrývá `braces_position`, `Squiz.Functions.MultiLineFunctionDeclaration` .[decision-facts]


braces.afterMultilineSignature
==============================

Where the `{` of a function and of a method whose parameters are spread over lines stands.

- `nextLineAfterReturnType`: below `): Foo` where a return type ends the signature, on the line of the `)` otherwise
- `sameLine`: on the line of the `)`
- `nextLine`: on the line below the `)`
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `sameLine`, psr12 `sameLine`, nette `nextLineAfterReturnType`, symfony `sameLine` · pokrývá `braces_position`, `Squiz.Functions.MultiLineFunctionDeclaration` .[decision-facts]

Hodnota `nextLineAfterReturnType` je volba Nette Coding Standardu: funkce bez návratového typu má `) {` jako v PER Coding Style, u funkce s návratovým typem stojí `): void` na samostatném řádku a závorka jde pod něj.

```neon
braces:
	afterMultilineSignature: nextLineAfterReturnType
```

```php .[before]
function send(
	string $to,
	string $subject,
): void {  // Expected a line break before the opening brace.
	mail($to, $subject);
}

function log(
	string $message,
)
{  // Expected no line break before the opening brace.
	echo $message;
}
```

```php .[after]
function send(
	string $to,
	string $subject,
): void
{
	mail($to, $subject);
}

function log(
	string $message,
) {
	echo $message;
}
```


braces.closure
==============

Where the `{` of a closure stands, the body starting a line below it and the `}` taking a line of its own.

- `sameLine`: on the line of what comes before
- `nextLine`: on the next line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `sameLine`, psr12 `sameLine`, nette `sameLine`, symfony `sameLine` · pokrývá `braces_position`, `Squiz.Functions.MultiLineFunctionDeclaration` .[decision-facts]

```neon
braces:
	closure: nextLine
```

```php .[before]
$double = function (int $x) {  // Expected a line break before the opening brace.
	return $x * 2;
};
```

```php .[after]
$double = function (int $x)
{
	return $x * 2;
};
```


braces.anonymousClass
=====================

Where the `{` of an anonymous class stands, on the next line always where its interfaces are spread over lines, the members starting a line below it and the `}` taking a line of its own.

- `sameLine`: on the line of what comes before
- `nextLine`: on the next line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `sameLine`, psr12 `sameLine`, nette `sameLine`, symfony `sameLine` · pokrývá `braces_position`, `PSR12.Classes.AnonClassDeclaration` .[decision-facts]

```neon
braces:
	anonymousClass: nextLine
```

```php .[before]
$logger = new class implements Logger {  // Expected a line break before the opening brace.
	public function log(string $message): void
	{
		echo $message;
	}
};
```

```php .[after]
$logger = new class implements Logger
{
	public function log(string $message): void
	{
		echo $message;
	}
};
```


braces.controlStructure
=======================

Where the `{` of `if`, `else`, a loop, `declare`, `try`, `catch`, `finally`, `switch` and `match` stands, the body starting a line below it and the `}` taking a line of its own.

- `sameLine`: on the line of what comes before
- `nextLine`: on the next line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `sameLine`, psr12 `sameLine`, nette `sameLine`, symfony `sameLine` · pokrývá `braces_position`, `PSR12.Files.DeclareStatement`, `Squiz.ControlStructures.ControlSignature` .[decision-facts]

```neon
braces:
	controlStructure: nextLine
```

```php .[before]
if ($ready) {  // Expected a line break before the opening brace.
	start();
}
```

```php .[after]
if ($ready)
{
	start();
}
```


braces.continuingKeyword
========================

Where the keyword continuing a structure after its `}` stands: `else`, `elseif`, `catch`, `finally` and the `while` of `do`.

- `sameLine`: on the line of what comes before
- `nextLine`: on the next line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `sameLine`, psr12 `sameLine`, nette `sameLine`, symfony `sameLine` · pokrývá `control_structure_continuation_position`, `Squiz.ControlStructures.ControlSignature` .[decision-facts]

```neon
braces:
	continuingKeyword: sameLine
```

```php .[before]
try {
	connect();
}
catch (ConnectionException $e) {  // Expected no line break before the `catch` keyword.
	retry();
}
```

```php .[after]
try {
	connect();
} catch (ConnectionException $e) {
	retry();
}
```

Styl, který každou větev začíná na novém řádku, napíše `nextLine`:

```neon
braces:
	continuingKeyword: nextLine
```

```php .[before]
if ($ready) {
	start();
} else {  // Expected a line break before the `else` keyword.
	wait();
}
```

```php .[after]
if ($ready) {
	start();
}
else {
	wait();
}
```


braces.emptyBody
================

How an empty body of a class, a function, a closure and a property hook is written; a comment inside makes it not empty.

- `ownLines`: `{` and `}` placed as those of any other body
- `sameLine`: `{}` on the line of the head
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `sameLine`, psr12 `ownLines`, nette `ownLines`, symfony `ownLines` .[decision-facts]

PER Coding Style prázdná těla zkracuje, a proto má preset `perCs` hodnotu `sameLine`; PSR-12 a ostatní standardy píšou závorky každou na svůj řádek.

```neon
braces:
	emptyBody: sameLine
```

```php .[before]
class NotFound extends Exception
{  // Expected no line break before the opening brace.
}  // Expected no line break before the closing brace.

class Point
{
	public function __construct(private int $x, private int $y)
	{  // Expected no line break before the opening brace.
	}  // Expected no line break before the closing brace.
}
```

```php .[after]
class NotFound extends Exception {}

class Point
{
	public function __construct(private int $x, private int $y) {}
}
```


braces.emptyAnonymousClass
==========================

How an empty anonymous class is written, whatever `braces.emptyBody` says; one written on one line stays where it is kept.

- `ownLines`: `{` and `}` placed as those of any other anonymous class
- `sameLine`: `{}` on the line of the head, one holding a comment staying on its line as written
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `sameLine`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `braces_position` .[decision-facts]


braces.singlelineClosure
========================

Whether a closure written whole on one line may stay so.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Požadavek · standardy: perCs `forbidden`, psr12 `forbidden`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `braces_position` .[decision-facts]

PSR-12 chce tělo každé closure na vlastních řádcích, a proto presety `psr12` a `perCs` mají `forbidden`.

```neon
braces:
	singlelineClosure: forbidden
```

```php .[before]
$ids = array_map(function ($row) { return $row->id; }, $rows);  // Expected a line break after the opening brace. // Expected a line break before the closing brace.
```

```php .[after]
$ids = array_map(function ($row) {
	return $row->id;
}, $rows);
```
